  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RAS ABU FONTAS WATER DESALINATION (RAF-A1)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROJECT AIMS TO RESPOND TO THE GROWING WATER DEMAND IN QATAR. THE RAF A1 PROJECT FACILITIES COMPRISE THREE MULTI STAGE FLASH_SYSTEM (MSF) DESALINATION DISTILLERS FOR THE PRODUCTION OF 45 MIGD (MILLION IMPERIAL GALLONS PER DAY) OF POTABLE WATER. THE FACILITIES WILL BE BUILT USING DESIGN, MATERIALS  EQUIPMENT.</narrative>
  </description>
